 his time and  go down and I got it nobody wants to  fall down in front of cameras no I get  it but just just to ask you you know  straight out is there anything about the  president's health that the America  public doesn't no no absolutely not it's  just fodder for for the critics out  there to attack us so of course it's not  surprising that Lara Trump says  everything's completely fine and there's  nothing to see here  about Donald Trump's health that's not  really why I'm talking about this the  point is the fact that this was even on  Fox News is huge because it means that  the issue of trumps health is now on the  radar of some of these right-wing Trump  sycophants who primarily get their news  from Fox News and wouldn't ordinarily  hear about this story so understand that  were it not for segments like this  there's a huge portion of the country  that wouldn't even know anything about  Donald Trump's confused speech and  limited reading ability visible  confusion the often dilated pupils while  sweating his strange stance and all of  these other signs that have been topics  of concern around the country for years  at this point in time so I'm not really  praising Fox News and any kind of  broader way but it's a good thing that  the story actually made it on the air  because this is likely the first time  that a ton of Trump astrak-- snooze  Watchers are even hearing about the fact  that there are health questions  surrounding Donald Trump now also just  kind of in the vein of fact-checking  remember that initially Donald Trump  explained the reason that he walked down  the ramp so slowly and gingerly was that  the ramp was slippery Donald Trump  tweeted over the weekend quote the ramp  that I descended after my West Point  commencement speech was very long and  steep had no handrail and most  importantly was very slippery the last  thing I was going to do is fall for the  fake news to have fun with final ten  feet I ran down to level ground momentum  so that